keywords:
  - speech-to-text
  - automatic speech recognition
  - Russian
  - offline dictation
  - voice typing
  - Linux
  - GigaAM
abstract: >-
  Golos is a free, open-source, offline Russian voice-dictation application for
  Linux/X11. It uses GigaAM v3 through ONNX Runtime, adds punctuation as part of
  recognition, and places the resulting text in the clipboard. Recognition runs
  locally without a GPU or network connection after the one-time model download.
